    <string name="settings_privacy_body">FamilyGuard collects only what the family features need:\n\n• Device identifiers and pairing metadata.\n• Foreground app usage times on the child\'s device.\n• Coarse and precise location on the child\'s device.\n• Time requests sent by the child.\n• Blocked domain names (stored locally, never uploaded).\n\nWe never collect messages, calls, camera, microphone or browsing content. Data is encrypted in transit. You can export or delete everything from Settings at any time. There is no third-party analytics or advertising in this app.</string>
